## Invariants

- No GitHub issue is opened by this ticket or its PR. The draft is the
  deliverable.
- The draft's evidence rests on measurement already committed under
  `bench/results/0629-gap-a/`, not on new claims invented for the issue.

## Exit criteria

- The issue is drafted, evidence-cited against a real checkout, staged at
